WEBVTT

00:24.573 --> 00:27.784
MANATSU ATAGAWA

06:30.188 --> 06:32.190
PLOD, PLOD, PLOD

06:57.382 --> 06:59.175
I WAS TOO SCARED TO COMPLAIN

06:59.259 --> 07:00.718
YOU'RE TOO BLUNT, MIKI

07:00.802 --> 07:02.720
THE WAY YOU SAY THINGS IS HARSH

08:08.786 --> 08:09.996
TOUCHED...

08:10.079 --> 08:11.206
YEAH!

08:11.289 --> 08:12.123
CRUSH

09:55.059 --> 09:59.689
ORANGE JUICE, HOT CHOCOCOA,
STRAWBERRY MILK

10:09.365 --> 10:11.993
NOT THE REACTION I WAS EXPECTING...

11:02.085 --> 11:03.169
I WASN'T NECESSARILY HANGING MY
HEAD BECAUSE I WAS BOTHERED...

11:08.466 --> 11:10.385
ALL ALONE...

11:26.526 --> 11:28.820
TOUCHED...

12:58.284 --> 13:00.036
SCHOOL NURSE'S OFFICE

13:15.176 --> 13:22.183
RUMBLE, RUMBLE...

16:09.392 --> 16:12.603
I WANT TO EAT OUT WITH THE GIRLS
WHERE'S A GOOD PLACE TO GO?

16:35.960 --> 16:37.670
KITAMURA > KITAMU > MU > MUKO

16:39.213 --> 16:42.049
FRIENDLY ATMOSPHERE

17:39.899 --> 17:41.650
I'M A DELINQUENT...
I HAVE A TROUBLED PAST

17:41.734 --> 17:42.568
I DON'T WANT TO HANG
OUT WITH YOU

17:42.651 --> 17:43.486
GULP...

17:44.028 --> 17:45.529
I'm someone I made up.

17:56.457 --> 17:57.917
GRUNT

18:07.927 --> 18:09.929
INTENSE

18:10.054 --> 18:12.181
GAPING...

19:07.486 --> 19:09.071
GUSH

19:09.155 --> 19:10.739
FLUSTERED

19:23.752 --> 19:28.632
PANIC PANIC

20:02.750 --> 20:07.671
INTENSE

22:55.798 --> 22:56.799
WARM AND FUZZY...

22:56.882 --> 22:57.883
EUPHORIA

23:08.519 --> 23:09.770
SHAKE, SHAKE

23:21.198 --> 23:23.033
STEP, STEP, STEP, STEP

23:42.719 --> 23:45.973
THUMP, THUMP, THUMP

23:47.224 --> 23:49.476
THUMP, THUMP, THUMP
